WEBVTT

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.820
You're slow, boy.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.030
You won't be able to hurt me...

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.600
if you keep running like that!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:47.450
With that level of strength, you dare to say such
things as,"Don't touch my friends?" Huh, boy?!

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.130
You're about to see my <i>strength</i>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.390
l'm going to...

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:06.170
defeat him!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.930
lf l were the rain

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.420
...that binds together the earth and the sky,
who in all eternity will never mingle

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.400
would l have been able to connect
and hold onto someone's heart?

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:43.740
6 Years Ago, June 17th

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.880
lt was raining that day.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:50.380
lt was also raining the day
before, and the day before that.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:54.550
The water level of the river rose
significantly due to the rain.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:02:01.750
Yet that girl stood there, swaying on the bank without an
umbrella, as if she was ready to jump in any minute.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.420
Wow! lt's splendid!

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.450
l'm going to be the women's Vale
Tudo champion in the future!

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.550
What about you, Orihime?

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.850
Have you done the art assignment?

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.520
''The Future Me?''

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.660
Thank you for asking!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.490
Actually, I'm secretly quite proud of it!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.790
Oh... how is it?

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:38.930
The Future Me?

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.840
The Future Me?
The maximum speed is 380 km/h!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:46.260
With a fire of 20,000 Celsius coming from the mouth...
and a special destruction laser from the eye...

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.330
That's not it, Orihime!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:50.940
You want to get detention again?!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.150
Good morning, Kurosaki-<i>kun</i>!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:00.910
Oh!

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:01.990
Morning, lnoue!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.520
What's up with Kurosaki-<i>kun</i>?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.360
lsn't he in a really good mood today?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.630
l wonder why he's so tense...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.660
Eh? Even though he's grinning that much?

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:15.830
l see...

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:21.840
Orihime, if you have any business with him,
you should hurry up and settle it today.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.670
He's... not coming tomorrow.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.820
This hill is tough...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.690
Really?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.820
lt's normal for me.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.360
By the way, if you say that..

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.360
Do your best Yuzu!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.860
Don't lose, Yuzu!

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:53.240
Dad's behind you!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:54.370
Look...

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:55.870
lgnore that, Yuzu.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.810
lf you go along with him, he'll get conceited.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.340
How naive...

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.820
Even if no one goes along with me,
l'll still get conceited automatically!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:08.310
Run!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.550
Must Kill Technique: Dad's Sliding!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.020
Polka dots...

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.420
Get lost! Go to the ends of the earth!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.560
Well then, let's go now, while we have the time.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.800
lchi-nii, too...

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:24.700
Yeah.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:28.910
Who's that?

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:32.140
Onii-chan, an acquaintance?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.910
Don't know! l don't know! l don't know,
not at all! Not even the slightest...

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.380
Hm... l feel like l've seen that person before...

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.720
l remember now!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.550
She's my classmate from junior high!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.920
l remember it clearly!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:49.230
This is bad! l'm feeling so nostalgic that l
want to talk with her alone immediately!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.400
On that note, l'm going to go talk with that person!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:55.300
You both go on to Mom's grave first!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.600
Onii-chan!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.140
Haha...

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.070
What's that ''haha''?

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:05.150
lt might be time for you let go
of big brother...

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.510
No!

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:14.990
We first met when we were four... at the
martial arts center that l had attended.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.530
With unbelievably orange hair,

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.760
hand-in-hand with an unbelievably beautiful mother,

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.720
wearing an unbelievably big grin, he came.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:28.430
Staggering and laughing frivolously, he looked so weak.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:34.800
One punch to the face!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.110
lt didn't even take ten seconds!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.800
Even though he was always crying,

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.950
once he saw his mom when she came to
pick him up, he grinned immediately.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.450
l really hated that.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.650
l said, ''A guy shouldn't be
laughing like that after losing!''

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.990
But he looked so happy,

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.960
laughing so happily...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.930
Why did you follow me?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.100
Really!

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:08.310
What do you intend to do if a Hollow
appears when l'm not around?

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:12.940
That's why...?! You...
I mean, if you have to follow me, be discreet about it!

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.880
Sorry about that... l didn't realize.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.610
You... Why are you angry?

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.650
Nothing. l'm not angry or anything.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:27.190
''She was killed.'' Last night, you said that,

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.360
that your mother was...

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.560
l didn't say that.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.200
Who was she killed by?

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.660
l didn't say that! Just forget it.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:40.210
You said that you've been able to see the
spirits for as long as you can remember.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.240
ln that case, answer just one thing.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:48.480
Wasn't the one that killed your mother... a Hollow?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.980
The possibility is there!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:56.750
lf your spiritual concentration is so dense that it
allowed you to see spirits for the longest time,

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:00.690
the Hollow that targeted you... could
have mistaken your mother for...

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.490
l can't take it.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.760
l can't take it!

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:15.610
By getting involved with you, anything and everything
automatically becomes the Hollows' fault.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:21.280
lt's already no joke that l've been
forced to exterminate monsters.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.950
As if l'll take that kind of reasoning blindly!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.650
lt wasn't a Hollow at all. Sorry.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.060
His mother died when he was nine.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:40.030
The frivolously laughing, clingy child also died.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.400
He didn't come to school.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.900
What do you think he was doing
when l went looking for him?

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:51.900
He was at the riverbank where his mother died,

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.440
shouldering his school bag while wandering around.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:08:01.350
He squatted when he was tired, but after a while
he stood back up and wandered around more.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:07.960
Day in and day out, from morning till night,
as if he were searching for his mother...

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:12.600
l couldn't stand to look at the lchigo of that time.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.200
<i>ki</i>//<i>ed her</i>...

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.410
<i>It was nothing</i> <i>less than that</i>.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.130
<i>Mommy!</i>

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.200
lt's been a while, Mom.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.740
Have you been doing well?

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:59.850
Well, since you're dead, l guess you can't be doing well.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:06.050
Over here, l, Yuzu and lchi-nii are doing well.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:07.380
lt's just that...

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.320
Now, now, now!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.580
The time for this year's customary...

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:16.050
''Jump! The Kurosaki Family Members Only
Gravestones Domino Competition'' is finally here!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.330
The first round is me versus lchigo!
The straightforward, bearded guy's
doing so well that it's a crime.

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:19.660
The straightforward, bearded guy's
doing so well that it's a crime.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.530
''The rolling and collapsing of gravestones into
pieces in a strict two and a half hours!'' game.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.330
The penalty of this game is that the loser
will have to be the winner's dog for a week!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.860
Shut up!
The penalty of this game is that the loser
will have to be the winner's dog for a week!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.010
Really...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.480
You should stop crying every year already.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:37.670
We turn eleven this year.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.050
We're almost adults.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.850
Yes, l know.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.860
l know, but...

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:47.660
H-Hey...

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.730
l'm an idiot.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.010
lt's near.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:08.880
Where is it?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:15.450
Damn it!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.550
Hey! What's that?!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.190
Eh? ls something there?

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.460
Karin-<i>chan</i>.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.660
Yuzu, don't come near!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.500
Karin-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.130
Don't come near...

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.570
Karin-<i>chan</i>! Karin-<i>chan</i>! What's wrong?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.780
What is this?!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:50.610
Hold on!

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.680
Grand Fisher!

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.440
To think that you know my name...

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:09.510
l take it that you're a Shinigami, then.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.110
What are you doing, lchigo?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.580
lf you mean your friend, he won't be coming.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.640
<i>I reall</i><i>y</i> <i>loved my mom</i>.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:45.740
<i>I'd never seen my mom crying or angry, not even once</i>.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.540
<i>That's why no matter how bad things were,</i>

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:52.180
<i>I'd forget everything when</i> <i>I was at her side</i>.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.390
<i>It wasn't just me</i>.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.680
<i>Yuzu and Karin, too</i>.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.190
<i>Even Dad</i> <i>loved Mom greatly</i>.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.410
<i>The cause is unknown</i>.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:18.070
<i>But it was clear that while trying to</i>
<i>save me, it turned out that way</i>.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:34.220
<i>In other words, the one who took</i>
<i>Mom away from the family is me!</i>

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.590
l don't like this... Really...

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.170
l don't know who you think you are...

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.580
Without knowing people's feelings...

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:52.910
you shouldn't be making my mom your toy!

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:00.620
You're...

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.410
Just a little closer.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.020
What?

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.390
You're too weak.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.930
And you're a Shinigami?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.140
You look tasty!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.780
ls it that fun to eat women?!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.080
lchigo!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:38.250
Hold on!

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:45.330
Rukia!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:46.730
lchigo!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.640
So you deceived me...

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.950
To think that you're a Shinigami...

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.380
And what do you think <i>you're </i>doing?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.250
Take care of Karin and Yuzu.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:14.620
l want to ask about your friend, the kid.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:17.060
This one?

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:19.590
What's up with you guys?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.360
She's the one from that time, the one at the riverbank...

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.200
six years ago!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.070
And why is she with a Hollow?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.770
Why did she take on my mom's form...

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:29.040
Why did she take on my mom's form...

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.740
You're noisy.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.840
ln that case, l'll tell you.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.030
How is it? Do you understand?

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:49.960
Grand Fisher.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.460
That's his codename.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:57.030
He makes the bait that grows from his head
take on a human form while he hides himself.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:01.970
Humans who have a dense spiritual concentration
are lured by that and get attacked by him.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.170
lt's a method that he uses frequently.

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:09.640
This time, in order to eat your sisters,
he used your mother's figure to stall you.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.340
He's a nasty piece of work. His favorite is women!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.320
Then, Mom was...

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.100
lchigo!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.700
Don't get emotional!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.940
Even if l say that, it would probably be useless.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:34.160
He's an opponent that has continuously
avoided the Shinigami for more than fifty years!

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:35.340
Be calm!

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:40.110
You think... Do you think that l
can act calmly at a time like this?!

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.040
That's careless, you idiot!

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:46.880
You're naive, boy.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.260
lchigo!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.230
Disintigrate!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.900
The Black Dog of Rondanini!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.270
Look upon yourself and incinerate...

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:08.870
and scratch away at your very own throa-!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.310
Stop it, Rukia!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.480
Stay back this time!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.940
l'll do this alone.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.480
Don't be stupid!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:21.950
He's strong!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.750
l just explained didn't l?!

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:24.450
Shut up!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.250
Please...

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.890
don't interfere.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.290
This is... my fight!

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.140
Eh? Nee-san?

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.950
Carry both of them to a safe place for me.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:55.960
What about you, Nee-san?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:58.960
l'm counting on you.

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.250
You're slow, boy.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:41.430
You won't be able to hurt me...
if you keep running like that!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:56.180
With that level of strength, you dare to say such
things as, "Don't touch my friends?" Huh, boy?!

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.140
You're about to see my <i>strength</i>

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:15.740
<i>I don't know how much pain Yuzu and</i>
<i>Karin went through with Mom's death,</i>

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.270
<i>but I've decided to protect them!</i>

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.140
<i>I will</i>..

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:27.880
<i>defeat him!</i>

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.150
How careless!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:40.010
Jumping into your enemy's range without a plan!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:40.930
Here.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.100
<i>What becomes of his pride?</i>

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.100
<i>Captain Ukitake!</i>

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.570
<i>If you help him, his life will be spared</i>.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:05.070
<i>But that would mean killing his pride for eternity!</i>

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.290
<i>What is pride?!</i>

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.920
<i>Remember this well</i>.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.320
<i>There are two kinds of fights</i>.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.560
<i>As long as we place ourselves in battle,</i>

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.630
<i>we must be able to distinguish between the two</i>.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.200
<i>There's the fight to protect one's life,</i>

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.260
<i>and then there's the fight to protect one's pride</i>.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.010
<i>That's right</i>

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.480
<i>This is a fight to protect one's pride</i>.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:44.360
<i>Don't interfere!</i>

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.360
Don't die, lchigo!

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:59.630
How thoughtless!

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:02.540
A fleeting emotion costs a friend's life.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:06.010
With a fleeting emotion, you
rush into your enemy's range.

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:10.150
This is how l toy with you...

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:13.750
You will die without inflicting any wounds on me.

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.650
Don't make me laugh!

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:19.290
l'm going to defeat you.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.490
Even if my arms are sliced into a thousand
pieces, even if my legs fly from my body,

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.390
l will definitely defeat you!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.900
That's why l said that you'd die.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:30.660
You're young.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:35.380
For that, you become angry
easily. Anger disrupts your mind.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:39.580
And since your mind is disrupted, your sword is blunt.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.350
lchigo.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.580
What's wrong?

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:49.580
You can't fight anymore just
because your name was called?

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:50.760
You...

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.150
Do you know what you're doing now?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:02.600
Don't bring out Mom's figure in such a place!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.200
No, lchigo!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:09.240
Draw back your sword! Don't cut me!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:14.250
Please...

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.950
This is the end, boy!

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:36.100
You're the youngest, most thoughtless,
and weakest Shinigami that l've ever met!

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:39.410
l've finally... caught you.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:45.240
''Anger dulls the blade?''

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:47.570
That might be true.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:51.310
But l said it before...

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:54.950
No matter what happens to me, l'll defeat you!

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.590
lt's the end, Fisher!

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:19.310
You're the oldest, filthiest and most
offensive Hollow that l've ever met!

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:42.360
l've underestimated you!

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:47.330
But you definitely couldn't cut your mother!

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:49.670
Oh stupid Shinigami,

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:53.180
we shall meet again!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:55.540
Wail a minute!

00:22:58.220 --> 00:22:59.190
lchigo!

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:01.710
Stop! lt's enough!

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:02.680
Hold on!

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:05.290
Stop it! Neither of you can fight anymore!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.720
The fight is over!

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:07.660
Not yet!

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:10.720
He's not dead yet!

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:12.260
l still...!

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:13.160
lchigo!

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:25.680
To still be alive after this wound...

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:29.250
This idiot's strength is something.

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:34.310
You're still alive, lchigo!

00:24:04.190 --> 00:24:04.980
l'm sorry.

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:07.420
l couldn't avenge you,

00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:09.420
Mom.

00:24:12.730 --> 00:24:13.620
Hey!

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:19.230
Dad...

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:25.000
Here, umbrella!

00:24:25.370 --> 00:24:26.740
lt's already stopped.

00:24:27.580 --> 00:24:29.770
l intentionally brought it for you.

00:24:29.980 --> 00:24:30.970
Hey, use it!

00:24:34.980 --> 00:24:35.970
That hurts!

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:38.180
The years go by so fast..

00:24:39.220 --> 00:24:41.620
Ten years since your mother passed away.

00:24:42.060 --> 00:24:43.150
Six years!

00:24:44.430 --> 00:24:45.220
How close!

00:24:45.730 --> 00:24:47.460
Not close at all!

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:51.090
lt's four years' difference! A grade schooler
could be a high schooler in that time!

00:24:51.470 --> 00:24:53.160
You say smart things...

00:24:53.300 --> 00:24:54.960
Don't be impressed!

00:24:55.100 --> 00:24:58.630
And at least remember the year
of your wife's death properly!

00:24:58.910 --> 00:25:02.140
Argh! Talking with you makes me angry!

00:25:02.780 --> 00:25:06.140
Well, to be able to see your cheerful form...

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:08.910
Your mother would be relieved on the other side.

00:25:15.020 --> 00:25:16.580
Didn't you quit?

00:25:23.530 --> 00:25:26.930
She complimented me, when we first started dating,

00:25:27.670 --> 00:25:30.470
that my hand looks cool holding a cigarette...

00:25:31.210 --> 00:25:37.470
When l think about it, that was the first and last time
that l was praised by your mother about my looks.

00:25:38.810 --> 00:25:42.040
That's why l decided to smoke
only on this day each year.

00:25:42.680 --> 00:25:44.450
ln front of her.

00:25:46.820 --> 00:25:48.980
Don't make such a rotten face!

00:25:49.360 --> 00:25:51.380
Didn't l just tell you to cheer up?

00:25:53.530 --> 00:25:54.490
l wonder...

00:25:55.230 --> 00:25:56.860
How can you laugh?

00:25:57.630 --> 00:26:00.360
Why is it that no one blames me?

00:26:02.400 --> 00:26:04.030
l couldn't do anything.

00:26:04.810 --> 00:26:06.030
l couldn't!

00:26:07.040 --> 00:26:08.410
Not when Mom died,

00:26:09.540 --> 00:26:10.640
not even now...

00:26:12.180 --> 00:26:13.340
This is too hard!

00:26:15.250 --> 00:26:18.050
lt would be better if you were to blame me!

00:26:18.750 --> 00:26:19.580
Why...?

00:26:19.750 --> 00:26:21.850
Why should l blame you?

00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:29.720
l don't know what you're worrying about,

00:26:30.030 --> 00:26:34.900
but if l were to blame you for Masaki's
death, l'd be scolded by her.

00:26:35.870 --> 00:26:38.530
Masaki's death was nobody's fault.

00:26:39.770 --> 00:26:47.010
Just know that the woman that l fell for was
a woman willing to die to save her child.

00:26:47.780 --> 00:26:49.250
And don't forget...

00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:55.450
You're the guy that the woman
l fell in love with died saving.

00:26:56.020 --> 00:26:56.960
Dad...

00:27:00.260 --> 00:27:01.230
O-Ouch!

00:27:02.060 --> 00:27:03.930
Live properly, lchigo!

00:27:05.270 --> 00:27:11.970
Live well, age well, bald well, and die after me.

00:27:13.210 --> 00:27:15.470
And if possible, die smiling.

00:27:17.240 --> 00:27:18.610
l'll be waiting down there.

00:27:24.890 --> 00:27:26.790
Are you listening, Rukia?

00:27:33.590 --> 00:27:37.220
Let me be a Shinigami for a little while longer.

00:27:39.900 --> 00:27:41.890
l want to become stronger.

00:27:42.400 --> 00:27:49.100
Much, much, much stronger... To protect
the people attacked by Hollows,

00:27:50.180 --> 00:27:53.010
to become strong... and defeat him!

00:27:54.950 --> 00:27:58.850
Else, l won't be able to face my mom!

00:28:01.260 --> 00:28:02.190
lchigo.
